From dbe50548ac47518e1dfe721b7a66f2f888fd74ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Code Review <review@local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:02:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: currency-aware formatting and backend error leak
 sanitization

- Replace hardcoded rupee formatting with currency-aware formatMoney()
  that respects the per-invoice currency detected by the backend
  (INR/USD/EUR/GBP), defaulting to INR. Aggregate views use the
  dominant currency across the dataset.
- Sanitize all 500 error responses: replace detail=str(exc) with generic
  messages. Full errors still logged server-side. Prevents leaking
  org IDs, API key fragments, and stack traces to clients.
---
